      "claim": "The main character in \"The Lost Prince\" is Eleanor Burden.",
      "answer": "Eleanor Burden",
      "quote": "\"The Lost Prince\" follows the character of Eleanor Burden, an 1890s Boston socialite who has resigned herself to marrying the man she should be with rather than the man she wants, whom she lost in Vienna.",
